          "reviewedOn": "2026-07-22",
          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures SQLiteStudio settings from %USERPROFILE%\\.config\\SQLiteStudio\\. The config store is a SQLite database (SQLiteStudio.db); an optional INI companion file (SQLiteStudio.cfg) is also captured when present. No credentials are stored, but the recent-files list embeds absolute local paths making the .db non-portable — restore is warn-only. Confidence: medium (config path confirmed via SQLiteStudio documentation and community reports; exact schema may vary across the 3.x build series). Authored secret warning: SQLiteStudio.db may contain absolute paths to user database files recorded as recent items. It is machine-local and MUST NOT be auto-restored; users should re-open their databases on the new machine. Authored excluded secret or machine-bound paths: %USERPROFILE%\\.config\\SQLiteStudio\\SQLiteStudio.db"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
